.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a bounded number of characters from a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy()
function copies at most
.I n
characters from
.I src
into
.IR dest .
If
.I src
is shorter than
.IR n ,
the remaining bytes of
.I dest
up to
.I n
are filled with null bytes.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters actually copied from
.IR src .
